":"|a||b|\\cos\\theta=a_{1}b_{1}+a_{2}b_{2}","title":"formula"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"derivation","text":"余弦定理给出 |a−b|²=|a|²+|b|²−2|a||b|cosθ。\n逐分量展开同一左式得到 |a|²+|b|²−2(a₁b₁+a₂b₂)，比较并约去公共项即可。","title":"derivation"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"worked_examples","text":"余弦定理给出 |a−b|²=|a|²+|b|²−2|a||b|cosθ。","title":"worked_examples"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"geometric_meaning","text":"余弦因子把 b 的长度投影到 a 的方向，代数分量乘积之和正好测量同一投影量。","title":"geometric_meaning"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"pitfalls","text":"把 |a||b|cosθ 写成 |a+b|；展开 (a−b)² 时漏掉交叉项。","title":"pitfalls"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"intuition","text":"余弦因子把 b 的长度投影到 a 的方向，代数分量乘积之和正好测量同一投影量。","title":"intuition"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"conclusion","text":"两种定义在固定欧氏内积下恒等；交换 a、b 数值不变。","title":"conclusion"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"invariants","text":"两种定义在固定欧氏内积下恒等；交换 a、b 数值不变。","title":"invariants"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"read_guide","text":"先看输入箭头，再沿关系读输出，最后用不变量核对图形。","title":"read_guide"}],"summary":"内积的几何定义 |a||b|cosθ 与代数定义 a₁b₁+a₂b₂ 描述同一个数。","symbol_roles":{"a":"vector_a","b":"vector_b","difference":"vector_a"},"title":"内积两种定义的几何等价","transfer_note":"将本主题的关系迁移到 ch01.inner.definitions，保持公式和图形不变量。","worked_examples":[{"calculation":["将给定的向量/标量代入讲义公式。","逐分量或按内积/投影定义计算中间值。","得到 result 对应的数值结果。"],"checks":[{"expected":11,"name":"result","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"given":[[1,2],[3,4]],"id":"example.claim.ch01.inner.equivalence","kind":"inner_product","result":11,"title":"讲义公式的可复算数值例"}]},"generated":{"artifact_digest":"sha256:c5276edb190370c0b23f571e6d7dd9c798fd80fd897eae1f9e8d53bacd00dbf3","generated_at":"2026-09-06T00:00:00Z","model":"lecture-grounded-v1","prompt_version":"teaching-artifact-v1","provider":"math-explanation-sample","raw_reply_digest":"sha256:be9796b3c942bca95d702fbc79e189fbe70a322654a2437a8939f801e36bba6c","source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6"},"revision":1,"schema_version":1,"source":{"excerpt":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。","heading_level":5,"heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"neighboring_titles":[],"occurrence":1,"source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","source_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"spans":[{"end_line":291,"fingerprint":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"id":"第1章 向量与几何测量 / 1.3 内积 / 两种定义等价性的证明::1::sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","start_line":255,"text":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。"}]},"status":"published","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":3,"required_sections":["definition","formula","derivation","worked_examples","geometric_meaning","pitfalls"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.inner.equivalence","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"b","kind":"vector","label":"b","role":"vector_b","value":[3,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"difference","kind":"vector","label":"a-b","role":"transformed_a","value":[-2,-2]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"rel.0.claim.ch01.inner.equivalence","kind":"compare","parameters":{},"source_ref":"a","target_ref":"b"}],"scene_kind":"2d","stages":[{"caption":"先读对象、角色和输入输出。","expected_invariants":["两种定义在固定欧氏内积下恒等；交换 a、b 数值不变。"],"id":"stage.claim.ch01.inner.equivalence.observe","input_entity_refs":["a","b"],"layout":"side_by_side","output_entity_refs":["difference"],"relation_refs":["rel.0.claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"title":"观察对象"},{"caption":"按公式计算并检查几何关系。","expected_invariants":["两种定义在固定欧氏内积下恒等；交换 a、b 数值不变。"],"id":"stage.c